<title>USA: Southwest Water Co increases qtly div.</title>
<headline>Southwest Water Co increases qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>WEST COVINA, Calif. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Water Co said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.09 per share.</p>
<p>The latest dividend represents a 20 percent increase over the prior dividend of $0.108 per share after the six-for-five stock split that was paid on January 20.</p>
<p>The latest dividend is payable April 18 to shareholders of record on March 31.</p>
</text>
